sequenceDiagram
  actor U as Pengguna
  participant FE as React
  participant API as Express
  participant DB as MySQL

  U->>FE: email + password
  FE->>API: POST /api/mp/auth/login
  API->>DB: SELECT user by email
  API->>API: bcrypt.compare
  alt sukses
    API-->>FE: Set-Cookie JWT
    FE-->>U: dashboard / beranda
  else gagal
    API-->>FE: 401 Email atau password salah
    FE-->>U: Alert
  end
